      "settings": {
        "heading": "Your metabolism + your mind: The Studies",
        "subtext": "Mood and metabolism are wired together. Women with PCOS have three to six times the odds of moderate or severe depression and anxiety. This page isn't about our products. It's about a link that's well established in the research and almost never mentioned in the appointment.",
