          "type": "attribute",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Observational",
            "popup_title": "What This Study Can and Can't Say",
            "popup_text": "This was a cohort study: it followed people over time and measured risk. It shows that insulin resistance predicts who develops low mood — not that one causes the other, and no supplement was tested in it. It's the 'why metabolism matters' link, not a product claim."
