        "background_heading": "Study Background",
        "background_text": "An independent double-blind, placebo-controlled trial: 12 g of inositol daily (n = 13) versus placebo (n = 15) for 4 weeks, in patients with low mood. The rationale: spinal-fluid inositol had been reported lower than normal in this group (Levine et al., 1995).†",
